ay of surgery so you can ask them questions too?\"\n\n**6. End with encouragement**:\n\"You know what I think? I think you are really tough. You have been dealing with your back hurting and your legs being tired, and you still come to your appointments and work hard in therapy. That takes a lot of strength. I am going to be here for you the whole way through this.\"\n\n**Key principles demonstrated**: Age-appropriate language, use of analogies, honest but non-frightening explanation, validation of emotions, giving the child a sense of control, parental reassurance, developmental appropriateness for an 8-year-old\'s cognitive level.',
